    <div class="body rv">
      <p>Sony brought Art of Visuals in to put the WH-1000XM3 headphones at the center of the creative process, a tool for the work, not another gadget. I pitched Flow State: five creatives, a director, a painter, a drummer, a ballet dancer, and a hip-hop dancer, each stuck in the noise until the headphones go on and the flow arrives.</p>
